## Running Locally

Run against the Agentforce BYOC runtime. Set your credentials first (the
command aborts with instructions if they're unset):

```bash
export ORG_JWT_TOKEN=<org-jwt>
export SFDC_CORE_TENANT_ID=core/<instance>-<fd>/<org-id>
export SFDC_USER_ID=<user-id>
export SFDC_APP_CONTEXT=<app-context>
agentforce run main.py
```

`run` executes your function on this machine; relay calls go out to the real
Agentforce service. The tenant id, user id, and app context are read from the
environment (`SFDC_CORE_TENANT_ID` / `SFDC_USER_ID` / `SFDC_APP_CONTEXT`).

